WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.706
Compare whole numbers from the highest place value. Use less than for less than,

00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:07.603
greater than for greater than and equals for equality.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:17.908
Choose the larger number: 19,692 or 17,923. The answer is 19,692. Compare the digits

00:00:17.908 --> 00:00:22.637
from left to right; 19,692 is larger.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:31.374
Fill the comparison on the scoreboard: 17,566 blank 19,233. Pause the video and

00:00:31.374 --> 00:00:31.983
think.

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:43.343
Fill the comparison on the scoreboard: 17,566 blank 19,233. The answer is less than .

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:46.863
17,566 is less than 19,233.
